# Normalise line endings.
#
# The Docker build and the CI workflows run on Linux. Without this, a Windows
# checkout with core.autocrlf=true can hand the Docker daemon a Dockerfile whose
# RUN continuations contain CR, which fails in ways that are very hard to
# diagnose from the build log alone.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Files that must stay LF for scripts to execute at all.
*.sh text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Windows-only helpers.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Never touch binary assets.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf binary
*.joblib binary
*.db binary
*.sqlite3 binary
*.bin binary
*.pickle binary

# Lockfiles and generated data: keep whatever they are.
uv.lock -text
package-lock.json -text
data/ml/*.csv -text
